---

This license covers the work authored in this repository: the application code,
the deployment files, the scripts under `scripts/`, the documentation and the
logo.

The idea and the base of the application come from **AceList**, by fabiomb:
https://github.com/fabiomb/AceList — a local catalogue of AceStream links, which
this project extends into a suite. That project **publishes no license**, and
nothing here grants one for its work.

What this project adds to that base is its own: the guide (EPG) layer, the search
page over the engine's index, the HLS bridge and the host jobs that feed the
playlists, the settings, the packaging and the logo. The code in `app/` has also
been rewritten in its expression, phase by phase and with the test suite as the
oracle; the behaviour is modelled on
AceList and the HTTP surface, the database schema and the user-facing strings are
deliberately the same.

If you redistribute this repository or an image built from it, you are
redistributing work derived from an unlicensed project. That is a question for
its author, not for this file.

The AceStream name and the mark inside the logo belong to their owner.
